              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "`external_whatsapp_message_id` must be the ID of the message inside WhatsApp. You can filter by this field to find messages in Close to update or delete based on updates or deletions in WhatsApp.\n\n`message_markdown` must be the body of the message in the WhatsApp Markdown format. The `message_html` read-only field will return the HTML representation of this message.\n\nTo include an attachment, you must first upload the file to Close using the [Files API](https://developer.close.com/api/resources/"
        },
